{"title":"The Corporate Underdog Who Does Everything Right","synopsis":"Chae Gyeong-jun, yang menyerah pada kuliah dan mimpinya karena krisis IMF, sekali lagi menghadapi keputusasaan karena biaya rawat inap neneknya yang tiba-tiba. Namun kemudian, seorang “Dermawan Misterius” turun tangan untuk menanggung biaya rumah sakit untuk keluarganya… “Siapa yang akan memberikan bantuan yang tidak membantu mereka sama sekali, dan mengapa?” Untuk mencari jawabannya, Gyeong-jun pergi ke Taeseong.","alternative_title":"A Corporate Underling Who Excels at Work, 대기업 말단이 일을 잘함, The Corporations Bottom Works Well","author":"Nanabi, Wintersleep Turtle","artist":"An Jeong Won","genres":["Drama","Seinen"],"chapters":[{"id":"49b9d74b-b776-4bb5-9ba7-80366c41a17d","number":"73","title":"Chapter 73","date":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"id":"5c1a7636-fa9b-4203-b538-2e332733fde5","number":"72","title":"Chapter 72","date":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"id":"d09a686a-0c1f-4917-9f2f-a6322e9316d6","number":"71","title":"Chapter 71","date":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"id":"88608b2d-68ba-4512-8fc1-9c5393dbddcd","number":"70","title":"Chapter 70","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"id":"a7ac941c-6605-44d4-a443-e8c8f22dbb01","number":"69","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2026-06-15","images":[]},{"id":"c926d62e-a205-442c-a009-eb0054a4b70d","number":"68","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-05-29","images":[]},{"id":"753edc1d-422a-4f8d-824d-ee0a6e31259c","number":"67","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-05-27","images":[]},{"id":"d2e0de49-4fc1-4405-89ca-16db88418c1b","number":"66","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"f8dadd54-8624-4a8a-b71a-edea584444a2","number":"65","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"ae8f02cf-324f-41b6-9e99-29b47b4b0c67","number":"64","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"fa87667d-b21b-417f-bc9a-3ef900746439","number":"63","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"e2cc8d2c-7635-4404-b3e6-107632e14e48","numb